[en.FOCUS_C11_WAR_OF_HOLDING]
War of Holding

[en.FOCUS_C11_WAR_OF_HOLDING_desc]
占领一块领土是一回事，守住它是另一回事。因此，在贸然仅供之前，我们需要做好预案：究竟要如何治理斑马部族呢？

[zh.FOCUS_C11_WAR_OF_HOLDING]
治安战争

[zh.FOCUS_C11_WAR_OF_HOLDING_desc]
Occupying a territory is one thing, holding it is another. Therefore, before we rush to occupy, we need to make a plan: how to govern the Zebra tribe?

